<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφάλ-ιγξ</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγγος</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρέφω, στροφαλίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whirl, eddy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν στροφάλιγγι κονίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.775
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ ς. κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.503
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀελλάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.446
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπνοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.140
				</span></i>
			; of water in a bucket, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.759
			</span></i>; of an earthquake, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				3.64
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. μάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.226
				</span></i>
			 (= <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				100
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄοκνος ς</span>., of existence,
				<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				148
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>curve, bend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				162
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				584
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				8.236
			</span></i>; <i>orbit</i> of a heavenly body, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				236
			</span></i>; of the bowels, <i><span class="en">
				Androm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>anything of a round shape</i>, e.g. <i>a cheese</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				697
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφιγξ</span>
			, <i>pivot, hinge</i>, Epigr. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.Par.</u>
				4.385
			</span></i>.</div>
